clear at 9.27 37.84 r=1.2 all only=SmallBoulder
clear at -38.79 -15.8 r=1.2 all only=SmallBoulder
clear at 10.16 38.45 r=1.2 all only=SmallBoulder
clear at -24.68 27.51 r=1.2 all only=SmallBoulder

save Skyhook Mast
